352
00:09:02,300 --> 00:09:04,100
Explore multiple careers.

353
00:09:04,100 --> 00:09:05,233
Build businesses.

354
00:09:05,233 --> 00:09:06,667
Create new technologies.

355
00:09:06,933 --> 00:09:08,433
And possibly contribute to

356
00:09:08,433 --> 00:09:10,433
discoveries that change the world.

357
00:09:10,433 --> 00:09:12,133
But there's one thing even your

358
00:09:12,133 --> 00:09:14,300
extraordinary ability can't change.

359
00:09:14,300 --> 00:09:16,000
Time. A day still has only

360
00:09:16,000 --> 00:09:17,767
