362
00:09:20,000 --> 00:09:21,300
You still need to eat.

363
00:09:21,300 --> 00:09:22,667
You still need to rest.

364
00:09:22,667 --> 00:09:23,867
And the people you love...

365
00:09:23,967 --> 00:09:25,667
Will continue growing older, just

366
00:09:25,667 --> 00:09:26,767
like everyone else.

367
00:09:26,767 --> 00:09:28,067
You might learn a lifetime's worth

368
00:09:28,067 --> 00:09:29,467
of knowledge in an incredibly

369
00:09:29,467 --> 00:09:30,367
short amount of time.

370
00:09:30,367 --> 00:09:31,767
But you can't live a hundred

371
00:09:31,767 --> 00:09:32,867
