375
00:09:36,267 --> 00:09:37,267
It's what you choose to do

376
00:09:37,267 --> 00:09:38,667
with everything you've learned.

377
00:09:38,667 --> 00:09:40,133
Because if you woke up tomorrow

378
00:09:40,133 --> 00:09:41,333
with the ability to learn one

379
00:09:41,333 --> 00:09:42,600
hundred times faster...

380
00:09:42,700 --> 00:09:43,933
What would be the very first

381
00:09:43,933 --> 00:09:44,833
thing you'd learn?
